// A FileGeneration config property name (Studio's grammar roundtrip case
// DSL_Generation-file-and-spec, 2026-11-14): legend-engine 4.145.0's rule is
// `configPropertyName: identifier (DOT identifier)*`, read with getText() -- the segments joined
// by `.`, whitespace between them dropped, and a quoted segment keeping its quotes on the wire.
###FileGeneration
